Package: simple-metricd
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libssl3 (>= 3.0.0), libc6 (>= 2.31)
Maintainer: SimpleDaemons <support@simpledaemons.com>
Description: Lightweight health check daemon
 simple-metricd watches configured HTTP/TCP endpoints, aggregates
 results, and fires simple alert hooks. v0.1.0 is the skeleton.
